%h3 Suggested Matches
%p.text-muted
  Clients with similar names, detected automatically. If a suggestion is itself a merged set, you can merge with the whole set or an individual client within it.
- if @potential_matches.any?
  .row
  .col-sm-12
    = simple_form_for @client, url: merge_client_path do |f|
      - @potential_matches.each do |k,clients|
        %h4
          = k.to_s.humanize.titlecase
        = render 'match_results', f: f, clients: clients
      .form-actions
        = f.button :submit, "Merge into #{@client.pii_provider(user: current_user).full_name}"
- else
  %p No potential matches found
